   "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">Sleep splits into:</p><ul><li><span class=\"hl p\">NREM</span> — non-REM, three stages, deepening rest.</li><li><span class=\"hl p\">REM</span> — eyes flicker, vivid dreams.</li></ul>"
